1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,580
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:11,150
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - because people

3
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:15,530
agreements are mutual, contracts feel one-sided.

4
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:22,770
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - authorizing feels like a choice, not a trap.

5
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:29,550
Don't say customer, instead say client - clients feel like partners, customers feel

6
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,700
like numbers.

7
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:38,480
Don't say buy, instead say invest - people invest in value, not purchases.

8
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:45,360
Don't say cheap, instead say affordable - affordable feels smart, cheap feels risky.

9
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:49,550
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

10
